{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Melstd.Hash_set_ident_mask</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"melange","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Melstd","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Hash_set_ident_mask","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Based on <code>hash_set</code> specialized for mask operations</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span>;</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-create\"><a href=\"#val-create\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> create: <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>;</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-add_unmask\"><a href=\"#val-add_unmask\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> add_unmask: <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ident</span>.t <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> unit;</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mask_and_check_all_hit\"><a href=\"#val-mask_and_check_all_hit\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> mask_and_check_all_hit: <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ident</span>.t <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> bool;</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>check_mask h key</code> if <code>key</code> exists mask it otherwise nothing return true if all keys are masked otherwise false</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-iter_and_unmask\"><a href=\"#val-iter_and_unmask\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> iter_and_unmask: <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">f</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ident</span>.t <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> <span>bool <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">=&gt;</span></span> unit;</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>iter_and_unmask ~f h</code> iterates over the collection and masks all idents, Warning: don't consult the collection in function <code>f</code>, since its state will not be consistent. TODO: what happens if an exception raised in the callback, would the hashtbl still be in consistent state?</p></div></div>"}